en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020040b30'>
//「そうさな。
//　……佐々木めがまたしても得意の寝返りを
//打ちおった」
"Indeed," the man growls. "That craven Sasaki has changed colors once again."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020040b30'>
//「そうさな。
//　……佐々木めがまたしても得意の寝返りを
//打ちおった」
"De fato", rosna o homem. "Aquele covarde do Sasaki mudou de lado mais uma vez."

en:
//　忌々しげな男の声。
//　それを聞いて、俺も気付いた。

//　一隊が鉾の向きを逆さにし、先刻までの仲間に攻め
//掛かっている……。
  His words call my attention to one corner of the battlefield, where I see a contingent of footsoldiers turning their weapons on the men they were fighting beside.

pt:
//　忌々しげな男の声。
//　それを聞いて、俺も気付いた。

//　一隊が鉾の向きを逆さにし、先刻までの仲間に攻め
//掛かっている……。
  Suas palavras chamam minha atenção para um canto do campo de batalha, onde vejo um contingente de soldados de infantaria voltando as armas contra os homens ao lado de quem lutavam.

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020050b30'>
//「どうにもならぬ」
"Nothing to be done."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020050b30'>
//「どうにもならぬ」
"Não há o que fazer."

en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0020060a15'>
//「<RUBY text='あきま'>飽間</RUBY>様も、支え切れぬようだ」
"Lord Akima's line will not hold for long."

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0020060a15'>
//「<RUBY text='あきま'>飽間</RUBY>様も、支え切れぬようだ」
"A linha de Lorde Akima não resistirá por muito tempo."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020070b30'>
//「……」
"......"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0020080a15'>
//「あの方の赤心忠義も、佐々木の裏切り根性
//には敵わぬか」
"So, even the most loyal of warriors is no match for a coward's treachery."

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0020080a15'>
//「あの方の赤心忠義も、佐々木の裏切り根性
//には敵わぬか」
"Então nem o mais leal dos guerreiros é páreo para a traição de um covarde."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020090b30'>
