//　まだ、続く」
"Not yet, child," the woman replies with a shake of her head. "There will be more battles. More war."

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0020280a15'>
//「まだだ。
//　まだ、続く」
