en:
//　その戦嵐は、百年に渡って大和全土を吹き荒れたと
//伝えられている。
  History tells of a conflict that raged across Yamato for nearly a hundred years. A terrible struggle, where rivers ran crimson and towers of the dead rose to challenge the mountains.

//　南北朝争乱。
  This is the Nanbokucho War.

//　俺の劒冑――村正が、生きていた世界。
  This is the world Muramasa called home.

pt:
//　その戦嵐は、百年に渡って大和全土を吹き荒れたと
//伝えられている。
  A história conta de um conflito que assolou Yamato por quase cem anos. Uma luta terrível, em que os rios correram vermelhos e torres de mortos se ergueram a desafiar as montanhas.

//　南北朝争乱。
  Esta é a Guerra Nanbokucho.

//　俺の劒冑――村正が、生きていた世界。
  Este é o mundo que Muramasa chamava de lar.

en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0020430a15'>
//「御父。
//　飽間様がお越しだ」
"Father. Lord Akima is here to see you."

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0020430a15'>
//「御父。
//　飽間様がお越しだ」
"Pai. Lorde Akima veio vê-lo."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020440b30'>
//「おう」
"Ah!"

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020440b30'>
//「おう」
"Ah!"

en:
//　<RUBY text='ひな'>鄙</RUBY>びた蝦夷村の素朴な屋敷。
//　そこに現れたのは、堂々たる風情の武人だった。
  The scene shifts to a rustic dwelling tucked into one corner of an Emishi village.

  The door slides open, admitting a tall warrior. From his regal bearing and fine raiment, I know instantly that he is a general in the Yoshino Emperor's service, which would put his station far, far above that of a lowly Emishi.

//　一郡一軍を預かる将領に違いない。
//　一介の蝦夷とは天と地ほどの身分差がある……筈だ
//が、家主は立ち上がりもせず、挨拶らしき挨拶もしな
//かった。
  Still, the master of this house remains seated, making no move to receive the man or offer him the place of honor.

//　武人に、それを不快がる気色はない。
//　……そういう間柄なのか。
  The warrior, for his part, does not seem to take offence. They must be old friends.

pt:
//　<RUBY text='ひな'>鄙</RUBY>びた蝦夷村の素朴な屋敷。
//　そこに現れたのは、堂々たる風情の武人だった。
  A cena muda para uma morada rústica escondida num canto de uma vila Emishi.

  A porta se desliza, deixando entrar um guerreiro alto. Por seu porte majestoso e suas roupas finas, sei na hora que é um general a serviço do Imperador de Yoshino, o que colocaria seu posto muito, muito acima do de um simples Emishi.

//　一郡一軍を預かる将領に違いない。
//　一介の蝦夷とは天と地ほどの身分差がある……筈だ
//が、家主は立ち上がりもせず、挨拶らしき挨拶もしな
//かった。
  Ainda assim, o dono da casa continua sentado, sem fazer menção de receber o homem nem de lhe oferecer o lugar de honra.

//　武人に、それを不快がる気色はない。
//　……そういう間柄なのか。
  O guerreiro, por sua vez, não parece se ofender. Devem ser velhos amigos.

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020450b30'>
//「無事で、何よりだ」
"It is good to see you alive."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020450b30'>
//「無事で、何よりだ」
"É bom ver que está vivo."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020460b50'>
//「見ていたか」
"You were watching, I take <br>it."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020460b50'>
//「見ていたか」
"Você estava observando, pelo visto."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020470b30'>
//「うむ」
"I was."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020470b30'>
//「うむ」
"Estava."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020480b50'>
//「佐々木も大した奴よ。
//　裏切る時と場所を決して間違えん」
"You have to hand it to Sasaki. He has a talent for picking the right moment to stab you in the back."

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020490b50'>
//「吉野山の方々は位階くらい気前良くくれて
//やるべきだった。
//　奴の訴えを聞き流していたばかりに、この
//ざまだ」
"The court in Yoshino should have given him the rank and honors he asked for. Then, perhaps, we could have avoided this mess."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020480b50'>
//「佐々木も大した奴よ。
//　裏切る時と場所を決して間違えん」
"É preciso reconhecer o mérito de Sasaki. Ele tem talento para escolher o momento certo de te apunhalar pelas costas."

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020490b50'>
//「吉野山の方々は位階くらい気前良くくれて
//やるべきだった。
//　奴の訴えを聞き流していたばかりに、この
//ざまだ」
"A corte de Yoshino deveria ter lhe dado o posto e as honras que ele pediu. Então, talvez, poderíamos ter evitado essa confusão."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020500b30'>
//「欲得ずくの輩など要るまい。
//　どうせ寝返る男なら、最初から敵に回して
//おいた方がましだ」
"Surely His Majesty's court has no need of such avarice. Better that men like him are sent to our enemy's camp <I>before</I> they turn traitor."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020500b30'>
//「欲得ずくの輩など要るまい。
//　どうせ寝返る男なら、最初から敵に回して
//おいた方がましだ」
"Certamente a corte de Sua Majestade não precisa de tanta ganância. Melhor que homens como ele sejam enviados ao campo inimigo <I>antes</I> de traírem."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020510b50'>
//「……あれはあれで筋は通しているがな。
//　領地を求め官位を求め、北から南南から北
//へと忙しく立ち回るのも、一族を守るためだ」
"He has his reasons. He may seem greedy, running from North to South, South to North in search of whoever will promise the most land... but it's all for the sake of his clan."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020510b50'>
//「……あれはあれで筋は通しているがな。
//　領地を求め官位を求め、北から南南から北
//へと忙しく立ち回るのも、一族を守るためだ」
"Ele tem suas razões. Pode parecer ganancioso, correndo do Norte ao Sul, do Sul ao Norte em busca de quem prometa mais terras... mas é tudo pelo bem do seu clã."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020520b30'>
//「本末転倒であろう。
//　将ならば、大義を守護するために一族の力
//を用いるべき」
"Then he is a fool. A true warrior knows that he and all his house exist to serve the emperor."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020530b30'>
//「一族を守るために大義を捨てて、何の武人
//か」
"Only a man with no honor would abandon his emperor for the sake of his clan!"

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020520b30'>
//「本末転倒であろう。
//　将ならば、大義を守護するために一族の力
//を用いるべき」
"Então ele é um tolo. Um verdadeiro guerreiro sabe que ele e toda a sua casa existem para servir ao imperador."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020530b30'>
//「一族を守るために大義を捨てて、何の武人
//か」
"Só um homem sem honra abandonaria seu imperador pelo bem do seu clã!"

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020540b50'>
//「うむ……」
"...Indeed."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020540b50'>
//「うむ……」
"...De fato."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020550b30'>
//「飽間様は、たとえ一族郎党悉く死に絶える
//始末となろうが、北朝方へ鞍替えなどなさる
//まい」
"You, Lord Akima, would never betray the South, not even if it meant the death of your line."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020550b30'>
//「飽間様は、たとえ一族郎党悉く死に絶える
//始末となろうが、北朝方へ鞍替えなどなさる
//まい」
"O senhor, Lorde Akima, jamais trairia o Sul, nem mesmo que isso significasse a morte de sua linhagem."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020560b50'>
//「当然だ」
"Of course not."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020560b50'>
//「当然だ」
"Claro que não."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020570b30'>
//「この伊勢國は神宮の膝元。
//　民が帝を崇め、逆賊を憎む気持ちは、どの
//國よりも強い」
"This land of Ise is home to the holiest of imperial shrines. No people in Yamato more faithfully worship His Majesty, nor pray more fervently for the usurper's downfall."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020580b30'>
//「断じて偽帝に頭は下げられぬ」
"We will never bow to the North!"

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020570b30'>
//「この伊勢國は神宮の膝元。
//　民が帝を崇め、逆賊を憎む気持ちは、どの
//國よりも強い」
"Esta terra de Ise abriga os mais sagrados santuários imperiais. Nenhum povo em Yamato venera Sua Majestade com mais fidelidade, nem reza com mais fervor pela queda do usurpador."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020580b30'>
//「断じて偽帝に頭は下げられぬ」
"Jamais nos curvaremos ao Norte!"

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020590b50'>
//「うむ」
"Indeed."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020590b50'>
//「うむ」
"De fato."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020600b30'>
//「勝たねばならぬ……」
"Victory must be ours."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020600b30'>
//「勝たねばならぬ……」
"A vitória tem de ser nossa."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020610b50'>
//「そのためには、だ。
//　村正。ぬしの力が要る」
"Which brings us to the reason for my visit. We have need of your strength, Muramasa."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020610b50'>
//「そのためには、だ。
//　村正。ぬしの力が要る」
"O que nos traz ao motivo da minha visita. Precisamos da sua força, Muramasa."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020620b30'>
//「……」
"......"

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020630b50'>
//「口にはされぬが、帝は待ちかねておられる
//ようだ。
//　楠木殿もな」
"Though he does not speak of it aloud, I know that His Majesty eagerly awaits its completion. Needless to say, so does Lord Kusunoki."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020630b50'>
//「口にはされぬが、帝は待ちかねておられる
//ようだ。
//　楠木殿もな」
"Embora não o diga em voz alta, sei que Sua Majestade aguarda ansiosamente que a obra fique pronta. Nem preciso dizer que Lorde Kusunoki também."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020640b30'>
//「うむ……」
"...I know."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020640b30'>
//「うむ……」
"...Eu sei."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020650b50'>
//「勢州桑名、千子村の<RUBY text='かじおさ'>鍛冶長</RUBY>は、五郎正宗の
//再来ならん……。
//　その風評が帝のお耳に届き、劒冑鍛造の勅
//が下って――早三年」
"Sengo Muramasa, master smith of Kuwana in Seishu, hailed as the second coming of Goro Masamune. Three years have passed since His Majesty heard of your skill and commissioned your forging."

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020660b50'>
//「まだ出来ぬか」
"You still need more time?"

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020650b50'>
//「勢州桑名、千子村の<RUBY text='かじおさ'>鍛冶長</RUBY>は、五郎正宗の
//再来ならん……。
//　その風評が帝のお耳に届き、劒冑鍛造の勅
//が下って――早三年」
"Sengo Muramasa, mestre ferreiro de Kuwana, em Seishu, aclamado como a segunda vinda de Goro Masamune. Três anos se passaram desde que Sua Majestade ouviu falar da sua habilidade e encomendou a forja."

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020660b50'>
//「まだ出来ぬか」
"Ainda precisa de mais tempo?"

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020670b30'>
//「まだだ」
"I do."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020670b30'>
//「まだだ」
"Preciso."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020680b50'>
//「ぬしの劒冑を楠木殿が身に纏い、南朝全軍
//を率いて押し出せば、北朝など一夜のうちに
//滅び去ろう」
"When Lord Kusunoki, clad in your mighty armor, marches at the head of His Majesty's armies, the North will fall in a day."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020680b50'>
//「ぬしの劒冑を楠木殿が身に纏い、南朝全軍
//を率いて押し出せば、北朝など一夜のうちに
//滅び去ろう」
"Quando Lorde Kusunoki, vestindo sua poderosa armadura, marchar à frente dos exércitos de Sua Majestade, o Norte cairá num dia."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020690b50'>
//「大和の民の待ち望む平穏がようやく訪れる
//であろう……」
"And Yamato... will at last have the peace it so desperately needs."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020690b50'>
//「大和の民の待ち望む平穏がようやく訪れる
//であろう……」
"E Yamato... enfim terá a paz de que tanto precisa."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020700b30'>
//「うても、そうあらねばならぬと思うておる。
//　だからこそ、軽々しく鍛造に踏み切れぬ」
"I too wish it to be so. And that is why I must approach this task with due diligence."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020710b30'>
//「やり直しは利かんからの……」
"There are no second chances."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020700b30'>
//「うても、そうあらねばならぬと思うておる。
//　だからこそ、軽々しく鍛造に踏み切れぬ」
"Também desejo que assim seja. E é por isso que devo encarar esta tarefa com o devido cuidado."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020710b30'>
//「やり直しは利かんからの……」
"Não há segundas chances."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020720b50'>
//「まだ工夫がつかぬか」
"You have yet to settle on a design."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020720b50'>
//「まだ工夫がつかぬか」
"Ainda não se decidiu por um projeto."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020730b30'>
//「というよりも、方向よな」
"Or rather, the course I should take."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020730b30'>
//「というよりも、方向よな」
"Ou melhor, o rumo que devo tomar."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020740b50'>
//「方向？」
"The course?"

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020740b50'>
//「方向？」
"O rumo?"

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020750b30'>
//「飽間様は、至高の劒冑とは如何なるものだ
//と思われる？」
"What would you consider the qualities of the ultimate tsurugi?"

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020750b30'>
//「飽間様は、至高の劒冑とは如何なるものだ
//と思われる？」
"Quais seriam, na sua opinião, as qualidades do tsurugi supremo?"

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020760b50'>
//「力が強く、甲鉄は硬く、翼は鋭く速く――」
"Irresistible power, impenetrable armor, unerring precision, and incomparable speed."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020760b50'>
//「力が強く、甲鉄は硬く、翼は鋭く速く――」
"Força irresistível, armadura impenetrável, precisão infalível e velocidade incomparável."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020770b30'>
//「出来るとお思いか？」
"Do you think it possible to achieve all of those things?"

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020770b30'>
//「出来るとお思いか？」
"O senhor acha possível alcançar tudo isso?"

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020780b50'>
//「……いや」
"...No."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020780b50'>
//「……いや」
"...Não."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020790b30'>
//「どれほど力量ある鍛冶師でも、万能の劒冑
//は打てぬ。
//　何かを選び、何かを捨てねばならぬ」
"No smith, however great his skill, can forge an all-powerful tsurugi. He must decide where compromises are to be <br>made."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020790b30'>
//「どれほど力量ある鍛冶師でも、万能の劒冑
//は打てぬ。
//　何かを選び、何かを捨てねばならぬ」
"Nenhum ferreiro, por maior que seja sua habilidade, pode forjar um tsurugi todo-poderoso. É preciso decidir onde fazer concessões."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020800b50'>
//「その選択が、定まらぬのか」
"And you have not yet made that decision."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020800b50'>
//「その選択が、定まらぬのか」
"E o senhor ainda não tomou essa decisão."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020810b30'>
//「うむ」
"Correct."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020810b30'>
//「うむ」
"Correto."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020820b50'>
//「何が最善、何が至高か……か？」
"What combination of qualities will produce the ultimate tsurugi... a conundrum."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020820b50'>
//「何が最善、何が至高か……か？」
"Que combinação de qualidades produzirá o tsurugi supremo... um dilema."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020830b30'>
//「至高の劒冑とはな、飽間様。
//　<RUBY text='・・・・・・・・'>役目を遂げる劒冑</RUBY>に他ならぬ」
"The ultimate tsurugi, Lord Akima, is simply one that fulfills its purpose."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020840b30'>
//「如何なる者の助けとなり、
//　如何なる者を討ち滅ぼすのか、
//　……まずそれを見定めねば、何も始まらぬ」
"What will it protect? What will it destroy? Until you know this, the forging cannot begin."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020830b30'>
//「至高の劒冑とはな、飽間様。
//　<RUBY text='・・・・・・・・'>役目を遂げる劒冑</RUBY>に他ならぬ」
"O tsurugi supremo, Lorde Akima, é simplesmente aquele que cumpre seu propósito."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020840b30'>
//「如何なる者の助けとなり、
//　如何なる者を討ち滅ぼすのか、
//　……まずそれを見定めねば、何も始まらぬ」
"O que ele vai proteger? O que vai destruir? Até que se saiba isso, a forja não pode começar."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020850b50'>
//「味方は南朝、敵は北朝であろう？」
"Protect the Southern Court and destroy the Northern. What else?"

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020850b50'>
//「味方は南朝、敵は北朝であろう？」
"Proteger a Corte do Sul e destruir a do Norte. O que mais?"

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020860b30'>
//「より深く。より細かくだ。
//　役目が明確であればあるほど、劒冑の性能
//を特化できる」
"Deeper. Narrower. The more strictly defined its role, the better it will be able to execute it."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020860b30'>
//「より深く。より細かくだ。
//　役目が明確であればあるほど、劒冑の性能
//を特化できる」
"Mais profundo. Mais estreito. Quanto mais estritamente definido for seu papel, melhor conseguirá executá-lo."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020870b50'>
//「……成程のぅ」
"...Most enlightening."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020870b50'>
//「……成程のぅ」
"...Muito esclarecedor."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020880b30'>
//「<RUBY text='はたらき'>機能</RUBY>を定めるにはまず目的を定める必要が
//ある。要はそういうことだ」
"The tsurugi's abilities must be molded to its purpose. Therefore, you must first <I>determine</I>㉓its purpose."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020880b30'>
//「<RUBY text='はたらき'>機能</RUBY>を定めるにはまず目的を定める必要が
//ある。要はそういうことだ」
"As habilidades do tsurugi devem ser moldadas ao seu propósito. Portanto, é preciso primeiro <I>determinar</I>㉓ o propósito."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020890b50'>
//「それで<RUBY text='いくさば'>戦場</RUBY>巡りか」
"And that's why you've been going from battle to battle. To identify that purpose."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020890b50'>
//「それで<RUBY text='いくさば'>戦場</RUBY>巡りか」
"E é por isso que o senhor tem andado de batalha em batalha. Para identificar esse propósito."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020900b30'>
//「うむ」
"Yes."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020900b30'>
//「うむ」
"Sim."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020910b50'>
//「結論は出せそうか？」
"Is the answer in sight?"

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020910b50'>
//「結論は出せそうか？」
"Já vislumbra a resposta?"

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020920b30'>
//「まだ、掛かるな。
//　まだ……倒すべき敵の姿が見えぬ」
"Not yet, I'm afraid. I still haven't found... my enemy."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020930b30'>
//「佐々木如きでは不足だしの」
"Sasaki is hardly up to the task."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020920b30'>
//「まだ、掛かるな。
//　まだ……倒すべき敵の姿が見えぬ」
"Ainda não, receio. Ainda não encontrei... meu inimigo."

//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020930b30'>
//「佐々木如きでは不足だしの」
"Sasaki não é o bastante."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020940b50'>
//「そうか……。
//　わかった。ぬしの存念はそれとなく楠木殿
//にお伝えしておく」
"Very well. I will relay what you've told me to Lord Kusunoki, when I return to court."

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020950b50'>
//「帝のお耳にも入ろう。
//　お二方とも納得される筈だ」
"I imagine His Majesty will hear of it as well. But fear not; they will understand."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020940b50'>
//「そうか……。
//　わかった。ぬしの存念はそれとなく楠木殿
//にお伝えしておく」
"Muito bem. Quando voltar à corte, transmitirei ao Lorde Kusunoki o que me contou."

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020950b50'>
//「帝のお耳にも入ろう。
//　お二方とも納得される筈だ」
"Imagino que Sua Majestade também ouvirá falar disso. Mas não tema; eles compreenderão."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020960b30'>
//「済まぬ」
"Forgive me."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020960b30'>
//「済まぬ」
"Perdoe-me."

en:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020970b50'>
//「なに。ぬしとわしの仲だ。
//　水臭い言葉などいらぬ」
"Forget it. There's no need for apologies between us."

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020980b50'>
//「ぬしは心ゆくまで工夫を続けろ。
//　その間は、わしが賊軍どもから吉野を守り
//通してみせる」
"Take as much time as you need to find your answer. Meanwhile, I shall guard Yoshino against the usurper."

pt:
//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020970b50'>
//「なに。ぬしとわしの仲だ。
//　水臭い言葉などいらぬ」
"Ora. Entre nós, não há necessidade de desculpas."

//【飽間】
<voice name='飽間' class='飽間' src='voice/md01/0020980b50'>
//「ぬしは心ゆくまで工夫を続けろ。
//　その間は、わしが賊軍どもから吉野を守り
//通してみせる」
"Tome o tempo que precisar para encontrar sua resposta. Enquanto isso, eu protegerei Yoshino do usurpador."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020990b30'>
//「……頼む」
"...Fight well."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0020990b30'>
//「……頼む」
"...Lute bem."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021000b30'>
//「…………」
"......"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021010a15'>
//「どうした、御父。
//　大層機嫌が悪いようだが」
"What is it, Father? You look so grim."

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021010a15'>
//「どうした、御父。
//　大層機嫌が悪いようだが」
"O que foi, Pai? Você parece tão sombrio."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021020b30'>
//「…………」
"......"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021030a15'>
//「<RUBY text='かか'>御母</RUBY>？」
"Mother?"

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021030a15'>
//「<RUBY text='かか'>御母</RUBY>？」
"Mãe?"

en:
//【始祖妻】
<voice name='始祖妻' class='その他女声' src='voice/md01/0021040b29'>
//「京の都が奪われたそうです」
"Kyoto has fallen."

pt:
//【始祖妻】
<voice name='始祖妻' class='その他女声' src='voice/md01/0021040b29'>
//「京の都が奪われたそうです」
"Kyoto caiu."

en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021050a15'>
//「……何!?
//　先月、楠木様が攻め落とし、帝は八年ぶり
//の帰京を果たされたばかりではないか！」
"What!? Not a month has passed since Lord Kusunoki recaptured the city! His Majesty had only just returned from eight years of exile!"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021060a15'>
//「洛中守護を拝命せし赤松の軍勢は何をして
//いたのだ」
"What happened to Akamatsu? Was his army not guarding the capital?"

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021050a15'>
//「……何!?
//　先月、楠木様が攻め落とし、帝は八年ぶり
//の帰京を果たされたばかりではないか！」
"O quê!? Não faz nem um mês que o Lorde Kusunoki retomou a cidade! Sua Majestade havia acabado de voltar de oito anos de exílio!"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021060a15'>
//「洛中守護を拝命せし赤松の軍勢は何をして
//いたのだ」
"O que aconteceu com Akamatsu? O exército dele não estava protegendo a capital?"

en:
//【始祖妻】
<voice name='始祖妻' class='その他女声' src='voice/md01/0021070b29'>
//「その赤松が、寝返ったのです」
"Akamatsu... betrayed us."

pt:
//【始祖妻】
<voice name='始祖妻' class='その他女声' src='voice/md01/0021070b29'>
//「その赤松が、寝返ったのです」
"Akamatsu... nos traiu."

en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021080a15'>
//「……何と」
"He... what?"

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021080a15'>
//「……何と」
"Ele... o quê?"

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021090b30'>
//「北朝に売りよったのよ！
//　都と、帝をな」
"He sold Kyoto to the North! And His Majesty with it!"

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021090b30'>
//「北朝に売りよったのよ！
//　都と、帝をな」
"Ele vendeu Kyoto ao Norte! E Sua Majestade junto!"

en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021100a15'>
//「帝が北朝の手に!?」
"The emperor... taken prisoner!?"

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021100a15'>
//「帝が北朝の手に!?」
"O imperador... foi feito prisioneiro!?"

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021110b30'>
//「……」
"......"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021120a15'>
//「では……南朝は、これから」
"But... what will happen to the court?"

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021120a15'>
//「では……南朝は、これから」
"Mas... o que será da corte?"

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021130b30'>
//「吉野の<RUBY text='みこ'>皇子</RUBY>が即位されると、飽間様は言う
//ておられた」
"Lord Akima says that His Highness the prince will take the throne in Yoshino."

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021130b30'>
//「吉野の<RUBY text='みこ'>皇子</RUBY>が即位されると、飽間様は言う
//ておられた」
"O Lorde Akima diz que Sua Alteza, o príncipe, subirá ao trono em Yoshino."

en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021140a15'>
//「……」
"......"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021150a01'>
//「みやこのおはなし？」
"Talking about the capital?"

pt:
//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021150a01'>
//「みやこのおはなし？」
"Falando da capital?"

en:
//【始祖妻】
<voice name='始祖妻' class='その他女声' src='voice/md01/0021160b29'>
//「……」
"......"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021170a01'>
//「ととさまは？
//　ととさま、みやこでしょ？」
"What about Father? Father's there, right?"

pt:
//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021170a01'>
//「ととさまは？
//　ととさま、みやこでしょ？」
"E o papai? O papai tá lá, né?"

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021180b30'>
//「……」
"......"

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021190a15'>
//「……御父」
"Father..."

pt:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021190a15'>
//「……御父」
"Pai..."

en:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021200b30'>
//「……<RUBY text='あやつ'>婿殿</RUBY>が……
//　御番鍛冶の端に加えられる栄に浴しながら、
//帝を捨てて逃げると思うか」
"...Your husband was a smith in His Majesty's own armory. Do you think he would forsake that honor and flee?"

pt:
//【始祖村正】
<voice name='始祖村正' class='始祖村正' src='voice/md01/0021200b30'>
//「……<RUBY text='あやつ'>婿殿</RUBY>が……
//　御番鍛冶の端に加えられる栄に浴しながら、
//帝を捨てて逃げると思うか」
"...Seu marido era ferreiro na armaria do próprio Sua Majestade. Acha que ele abandonaria essa honra e fugiria?"

en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021210a15'>
//「…………」
"......"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021220a01'>
//「かかさま。
//　ねえ、ととさまは？」
"Mother? What happened to Father?"

pt:
//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021220a01'>
//「かかさま。
//　ねえ、ととさまは？」
"Mãe? O que aconteceu com o papai?"

en:
//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md01/0021230a15'>
//「……………………」
"......"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021240a01'>
//「ばばさま……
//　ととさまは？」
"Grandmother? Is Father coming home?"

pt:
//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021240a01'>
//「ばばさま……
//　ととさまは？」
"Vovó? O papai vai voltar para casa?"

en:
//【始祖妻】
<voice name='始祖妻' class='その他女声' src='voice/md01/0021250b29'>
//「…………」
"......"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0021260a01'>
//「……じじさま……？」
"Grandfather...?"

